  (c) Licensee may retain Expertise Files without restriction;
  (d) All restrictions on commercialisation and distribution remain in effect.

7.3 TERMINATION FOR CAUSE

This License terminates immediately upon:

  (a) Termination of the MSA for cause by BlueCube AI BV;
  (b) Material breach of this License by Licensee;
  (c) Licensee's attempt to commercialise or distribute the Framework in 
      violation of Section 3.

7.4 EFFECT OF TERMINATION FOR CAUSE

Upon termination for cause, Licensee must immediately:

  (a) Cease all use of the Framework;
  (b) Remove the Framework (the .claude/ directory) from all repositories;
  (c) Licensee may retain Expertise Files that were generated during the 
      Subscription Term.

7.5 SURVIVAL

Sections 3 (Restrictions), 4 (Intellectual Property), 8 (Disclaimer), and 
9 (Limitation of Liability) survive termination or expiry of this License.

